"The slimes gather because they are drawn to Nala's dimensional mana."
"The slimes follow Nala about and grow calm near her."
"The larger slimes are pulled in from farther off by the same draw of her mana."
"For weeks before she came, space on the common thinned as her arrival was readied."
"That thinning drew slimes to the common before Nala woke, so their numbers grew daily."
